# Rows to merge into docs/TECH-DEBT.md

Source: Phase 2 (refactoring-patterns), first pass on `play/src/pusher/services/SocketManager.ts` (2026-11-12). Baseline `HEAD` = `08040b7e0`, `SocketManager.ts` sha256 `de35ca77…09c68673` (1,822 lines). After the five patches: `4c6ffd63…a5dae64` (1,841 lines). Evidence: `docs/audits/tech-debt/phase2-socketmanager/README.md`. Locations marked "after" are line numbers in the patched file; the others are `HEAD`'s.

## Debt Ledger: status updates

| Item | New status |
|---|---|
| SM-02 | Unchanged. The `userId` write and the analytics `open` of a late join now sit in `handleMessageFromBack` (after `:332-349`), moved verbatim. The remainder is still not pinned. |
| SM-06 | Unchanged. The constructor (after `:115-128`) still registers four global listeners. |

