| Side effect before validation (SM-01) | after `:702-712` | open (unchanged) |
| Back-message side effects run for a closed socket; only the relay checks it (SM-02) | after `:322-366` (`handleMessageFromBack`) | unchanged: fixed by `322c7704c` for the viewport; the `userId` write and the analytics `open` still run |
| Constructor parameter typed as the class (`SpaceConnection`) | after `:115` | done by `05-extract-space-connection-interface.patch` (Extract Interface, type-only: the parameter is now `SpaceConnectionInterface`, still defaulting to `new SpaceConnection()`). The test's cast `satisfies SpaceConnectionInterface as unknown as SpaceConnection` and its comment are gone. |
